11d7cf88-e112-4412-af86-72a4f9631ed5,2026-08-18T14:47:19.164Z,1,3,"U1: How to find difference in an arithmetic sequences
U2: Yess
U3: What is the equation to find common difference",**The equation for the common difference \(d\) in an arithmetic sequence is:** - From consecutive terms: \[ d = a_{n+1} - a_n \] - From the first term \(a_1\) and the \(n\)th term \(a_n\): \[ d = \frac{a_n - a_1}{n - 1} \] - From any two terms \(a_m\) and \(a_n\): \[ d = \frac{a_n - a_m}{n - m} \],Conceptual,,,,,Academic,,,,1772,62,0.000808,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Concept Explanation,gate_llm,gate_llm
