U8: What types of medicines use mRNA technology","**mRNA technology is mainly used in vaccines and a few newer “gene-therapy–like” medicines.** In these medicines, mRNA gives your cells temporary instructions to make a specific protein, which trains the immune system or replaces a missing protein for a short time. **Types of medicines that use mRNA",Quiz_request,,,,,Academic,,,,1795,63,0.000819,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Practice / Quiz,gate_llm,gate_llm
