U3: Did you short well short paragraph on mould board flow and disclose","**In a mouldboard plough, the soil “flow” happens as the share cuts a slice of soil and pushes it onto the mouldboard. The mouldboard then lifts the slice, breaks it a little, and turns it over to one side, forming a furrow and often burying weeds or crop residue. “Disclose” means to reveal or make ",Small Talk,,,,,Academic,,,,1741,62,0.000796,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Concept Explanation,gate_llm,gate_llm
