7aa459dc-1c8c-41cd-90b7-a8b2b373ffce,2026-08-18T14:13:42.484Z,31259634,3,"U1: How do I convert pounds to ounces
U2: Hi
U3: Share me a trick for this","**Trick: think “lb → oz = add a 0, then add half.”** Because \(16 = 10 + 5 + 1\). So for \(x\) pounds: - \(10x\) (add a 0) - \(+5x\) (half of \(10x\)) - \(+x\) - total \(= 16x\) ounces Example: \(7\) lb \(10\times7=70\), half of that is \(35\), plus \(7\): \(70+35+7=112\) oz. Want a trick for **ounc",Unit Conversion,,,,,Academic,,,,1785,62,0.000391,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Concept Explanation,gate_llm,gate_llm
