U2: रैखिक समीकरणों को \[ 3(t-3)=5(2 t+1) \]
U3: (g) \( x-\frac{x-2}{7}+36=\frac{9 x+7}{2} \)","Start by clearing the denominators \(7\) and \(2\). The LCM is \(14\), so multiply **every** term by \(14\): \[ 14\left(x-\frac{x-2}{7}+36\right)=14\left(\frac{9x+7}{2}\right) \] Distribute: \[ 14x - 14\cdot \frac{x-2}{7} + 14\cdot 36 = 7(9x+7) \] Simplify each part: \[ 14x - 2(x-2) + 504 = 63x + 49",Procedural,,,,,Academic,,,,1932,64,0.000875,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
