U5: 1","Let’s do **1) Profit/Loss**: \(CP = ₹800,\; SP = ₹920\) 1. **Type:** \(SP > CP\), so there is **profit**. 2. **Profit amount:** \[ \text{Profit} = SP - CP = 920 - 800 = ₹120 \] 3. **Profit %:** \[ \text{Profit \%} = \frac{\text{Profit}}{CP} \times 100 = \frac{120}{800} \times 100 = \frac{12000}{800}",Conceptual,,,,,Academic,,,,1784,63,0.000814,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Summary / Notes,gate_llm,gate_llm
