U13: could you please shorten these answers for about 2 marks and easy to Remember short these two answers Flexi what is the most important questions in state syllabus in 8th standard in geography Indian Standard Time Greenwich mean time or standard time or local time Apparent home window of the Sun time zone and international date line please answer could you please answer these questions for about and very very easy easy to Remember","### 2-mark, easy-to-remember answers (Time & Sun)

#### **1) Indian Standard Time (IST)**
- India’s **official time** is IST. 
- It is based on **82°30′E (Standard Meridian)**.

#### **2) Greenwich Mean Time (GMT)**
- **GMT** is the time at **0° longitude (Greenwich)**. 
- It is the **world reference time**.

#### **3) Standard Time**
- The **common time** followed in a whole country. 
- It is taken from the country’s **standard meridian**.

#### **4) Local Time**
- The time of a place based on the **Sun’s position** there. 
- It changes with **longitude**.

#### **5) Apparent movement of the Sun**
- The Sun seems to move **north or south** during the year. 
- This happens because the **Earth revolves** around the Sun.

#### **6) Uttarayanam**
- From about **22 Dec**, Sun appears to move **northward**. 
- From **Tropic of Capricorn → Tropic of Cancer**.

#### **7) Dakshinayanam**
- From about **21 Jun**, Sun appears to move **southward**. 
- From **Tropic of Cancer → Tropic of Capricorn**.

#### **8) Time Zone**
- A region that follows the **same time**. 
- Earth has **24 time zones** (about **15°** each).

#### **9) International Date Line (IDL)**
- An imaginary line near **180° longitude**. 
- Crossing it **changes the date by 1 day**.",Conceptual,5,5,5,10,Academic | Not Math/Science | Specific Named Resource | Image Upload | Speech to Text | Slotfill,,,0.9800,15147,375,0.003839,"The bot correctly understood and responded to the user's academic queries about social science topics, including geography and history. It handled image input well and provided concise, accurate answers with appropriate use of slotfill templates. There are no detected failures or issues in the conversation.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,multiple_similar_requests | gate_llm,gate_llm
