U11: Sinx ka formula","**\(\sin x\)** के कुछ सबसे काम के फ़ॉर्मूले:

- **समकोण त्रिभुज में:** \(\displaystyle \sin x=\frac{\text{लंब}}{\text{कर्ण}}\)
- **पूरक कोण:** \(\sin(90^\circ-x)=\cos x\)
- **ऋणात्मक कोण:** \(\sin(-x)=-\sin x\)

- **योग/अंतर:**
\[
\sin(a+b)=\sin a\cos b+\cos a\sin b
\]
\[
\sin(a-b)=\sin a\cos b-\cos a\sin b
\]

- **दुगुना कोण:**
\[
\sin(2x)=2\sin x\cos x
\]

- **आधा कोण:**
\[
\sin\left(\frac{x}{2}\right)=\pm\sqrt{\frac{1-\cos x}{2}}
\]

तुम्हें इनमें से **कौन-सा वाला** चाहिए था—त्रिभुज वाला, योग/अंतर, या \(2x\)/\(x/2\) वाला?",Small Talk,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic,,,0.9500,13019,216,0.003202,"The conversation is a straightforward academic math help session with no bot failures or misunderstandings. The bot correctly interprets and responds to the user's requests, providing explanations and clarifications as needed. There is no evidence of user frustration or bot errors.",0,full_rate,Academic,Concept Explanation,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
