U37: Mera answer to 14 andhe aa raha hai","**नहीं, सही उत्तर \(14\) नहीं है। सही योग \(\mathbf{\frac{47}{6}}\) (यानी \(7\frac{5}{6}\)) आता है।**

चलो जल्दी से जाँच करते हैं:

\[
\frac{7}{3}+\frac{5}{2}+\frac{6}{2}
\]

पहले एक ही हर (denominator) वाले जोड़ो:
\[
\frac{5}{2}+\frac{6}{2}=\frac{11}{2}
\]

अब:
\[
\frac{7}{3}+\frac{11}{2}
\]

LCM \(=6\):
\[
\frac{7}{3}=\frac{14}{6},\quad \frac{11}{2}=\frac{33}{6}
\]

\[
\frac{14}{6}+\frac{33}{6}=\frac{47}{6}=7\frac{5}{6}
\]

अगर आपके हिसाब से \(14\) आ रहा है, तो एक बार बताइए आपने कौन सा step किया—कहाँ पर common denominator लिया था?",Small Talk,5,5,5,10,Academic | Not Math/Science | Speech to Text | Slotfill,,,0.9800,21161,321,0.004608,"The conversation is a clear academic session focused on English language and communication topics, with the bot providing detailed, accurate, and contextually appropriate answers. There are no evident bot failures or user complaints, and the bot handles speech-to-text inputs and slotfill templates effectively without user rejection or confusion.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
