\[
C = 2\pi r = 2\pi \times 150 = 300\pi\ \text{m}
\]

समय \(t = 12\ \text{s}\) है, तो चाल:
\[
v = \frac{C}{t} = \frac{300\pi}{12} = 25\pi\ \text{m/s} \approx 78.5\ \text{m/s}
\]

