#### **Morning (2–2.5 hours) — Tough subject**
- 30 min: important topics list + quick notes
- 60–75 min: main chapter/concept practice
- 30 min: short questions/answers

#### **Afternoon (1.5–2 hours) — Second subject**
- 20 min: revision (headings, definitions)
- 60 min: writing practice (2–3 long answers)
- 20–30 min: previous questions

#### **Evening (1–1.5 hours) — Third subject (light)**
- 30–40 min: key points/diagrams/maps/dates
- 30–40 min: MCQ/very short answers

#### **Night (20–30 min) — Final recap**
- Sirf formulas/definitions/dates/keywords

