For \(\frac{2}{7}\times\frac{3}{5}\):

- Multiply the numerators (top): \(2\times 3 = 6\)
- Multiply the denominators (bottom): \(7\times 5 = 35\)

So,
\[
\frac{2}{7}\times\frac{3}{5}=\frac{6}{35}.
