\]",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Image Upload,,,0.9500,14454,262,0.003575,"The bot correctly answered all user queries with accurate dimensional analysis explanations and conversions, including interpreting image content properly. There were no failures or misunderstandings, but the user did rephrase some requests, indicating neutral sentiment without explicit satisfaction or complaint. Overall, the session is a clean academic interaction with image uploads and no issues.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | correction | gate_llm,gate_llm
