faa55f5e-1155-4e74-9d28-ec4717d2244b,2026-08-18T14:36:03.493Z,1,4,"U1: Solve this problem

A Grade 7 geometry problem asks students to find the angle labeled a in a diagram containing two parallel horizontal lines intersected by slanted transversals, with angles marked 42° and 100°.
