## 2) Real life Iron Man suit se kya nuksan ho sakta hai

Movie jaisa Iron Man suit real life mein banana ya pehenna bahut dangerous hoga. Isse:

- **Body ko nuksan** ho sakta hai: heavy metal parts, sharp edges, girne ka risk, bones ya muscles ko chot.
