a\ \frac{b}{c}\;=\;\frac{ac+b}{c}
\]
(Whole number \(a\) ko denominator \(c\) se multiply karo, numerator \(b\) add karo, denominator same \(c\) rahega.)

Example: 
\[
3\frac{2}{7}=\frac{3\cdot 7+2}{7}=\frac{23}{7}
\]

