e52058d8-da0f-4754-883b-d77d37738cc8,2026-08-18T14:15:36.748Z,1,5,"U1: Do the e one class 5

The image shows a worksheet asking students to arrange fractions in ascending order. The student asks for help with part e, which lists 5/11, 3/5, 7/11, and 1/8.
