- **Transparent:** see clearly (clear glass, clean water) 
- **Translucent:** see partly (butter paper, frosted glass) 
- **Opaque:** can’t see through (wood, metal)
- **Soluble in water:** salt, sugar 
- **Insoluble:** sand, chalk powder (doesn’t dissolve)
- **Float on water (usually):** wood, plastic bottle cap 
- **Sink:** stone, iron nail (usually)
- **Conductor (electricity/heat):** metals like iron, copper, aluminium 
