U7: Explain a Hindi","**हाँ, मैं हिन्दी में समझा देता हूँ।** 
यहाँ **\(p = 5\)** दिया है। मतलब हर जगह जहाँ **\(p\)** है, वहाँ **5** लिख देना है।

### (i) \(p + p^2\)
- \(p=5\) ⇒ \(5 + 5^2\) 
- \(5^2 = 5\times5 = 25\) 
- \(5 + 25 = \mathbf{30}\)

### (ii) \(4 + 3p - p^2\)
- \(4 + 3(5) - 5^2\) 
- \(3(5)=15\), \(5^2=25\) 
- \(4 + 15 - 25 = 19 - 25 = \mathbf{-6}\)

### (iii) \(5p^2 - 8p\)
- \(5(5^2) - 8(5)\) 
- \(5^2=25\) ⇒ \(5\times25=125\) 
- \(8\times5=40\) 
- \(125 - 40 = \mathbf{85}\)

### (iv) \(p^3 - 4p\)
- \(5^3 - 4(5)\) 
- \(5^3 = 5\times5\times5 = 125\) 
- \(4(5)=20\) 
- \(125 - 20 = \mathbf{105}\)

**उत्तर:** (i) 30, (ii) -6, (iii) 85, (iv) 105",NA,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Not Math/Science | Specific Named Resource | Direct Response | Image Upload,,,0.9500,13536,333,0.003413,"The bot correctly answered all user queries including math and Hindi explanations and responded appropriately to the image-uploaded question. There were no failures or misunderstandings, and the user asked for direct explanations which the bot provided. Overall, the session was successful with no technical or content issues.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | same_intent_reask | gate_llm,gate_llm
