### 1) Must-know words
- **मैं** = I 
- **तुम** = you 
- **वह** = he/she/that 
- **यह** = this 
- **और** = and 
- **है** = is 
- **नहीं** = no / not 

### 2) Very common sentences
- **मेरा नाम ___ है।** = My name is ___.
- **मैं ठीक हूँ।** = I am fine.
- **मुझे हिंदी सीखनी है।** = I want to learn Hindi.

### 3) Reading tip (simple)
Hindi is written in **Devanagari**. Words are connected by the **top line** (शिरोरेखा). Try reading **one word at a time**, slowly.

