cf5a8252-b6c2-4198-ba0c-f376f58743d8,2026-08-18T13:44:36.047Z,1,3,"U1: Give me extra question with answer from the page and long answer from the page

A biology textbook page explains how traits are expressed, including Mendelian inheritance, dominant and recessive traits, genes, alleles, and pea-plant experiments. The page includes diagrams showing trait inheritance and independent assortment.
