U13: Scene 7 and 8 very funny can u generate","Here are **Scene 7 and Scene 8**, very funny, with **English + Kannada** for your 13‑character café skit.

---

## Scene 7 – Teacher & Grandparent Twist

**Narrator:** 
English: Just when students think it cannot get worse… one more danger enters. 
Kannada: Students “ಇದಕ್ಕಿಂತ worst ಆಗೋದಿಲ್ಲ” ಅಂದ್ರೆ… ಅಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿ ಇನ್ನೋಬ್ಬ danger enter ಆಗ್ತಾನೆ.

**Teacher enters, holding notebook.**

**Teacher:** 
English: So this is where my “missing students” are hiding. 
Kannada: ಅಹಾ, ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಇತ್ತೀರಾ ನನ್ನ “missing students” ಎಲ್ಲರೂ!

**Student 1 (jumps up, fake respect):** 
English: Good afternoon, ma’am! I was just… revising formulas. 
Kannada: Good afternoon, ma’am! ನಾನು ಇಲ್ಲಿ formulas revise ಮಾಡ್ತಾ ಇದ್ದೆ.

**Student 2 (quickly closes phone):** 
English: Yes ma’am, we were doing *group study*. 
Kannada: ಹೌದು ma’am, ನಾವು ಇಲ್ಲಿ group study ಮಾಡ್ತಾ ಇದ್ದೆವು.

**Teacher (deadpan):** 
English: Group study? Looks more like group eating. 
Kannada: Group study ಅಲ್ಲ, group eating ತೋರ್ತಾ ಇದೆ.

**Parent (to Teacher):** 
English: Ma’am, if they don’t study here, please give extra homework. 
Kannada: Ma’am, ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಓದ್ಲಿಲ್ಲ ಅಂದ್ರೆ, extra homework ಕೊಡ್ಬಿಡಿ.

**Students (together):** 
English: Aunty, betrayal! 
Kannada: Aunty, ಇಷ್ಟು betrayal ಬೇಡ ಅಲ್ವಾ!

---

**Narrator:** 
English: At this emotional moment, one person enters who fears nobody… 
Kannada: ಈ emotional ಸಮಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಒಬ್ಬರು enter ಆಗ್ತಾರೆ… ಯಾರನ್ನೂ ಭಯಪಡೋದಿಲ್ಲ…

**Grandparent walks in slowly with walking stick, very cool.**

**Grandparent:** 
English: Ayyo, so much noise for one small coffee shop? In my time, we had no Wi‑Fi, no AC… only strong tea and stronger teachers. 
