1) \(5^2\pi < 2\sqrt{7}\) 
2) \(5^2\pi < 2 \times \sqrt{7}\) (same as #1) 
3) Something like “\(5^2\pi < 2\)” **for all** \( \sqrt{7}\) (which doesn’t make sense since \(\sqrt{7}\) is just a number)

