8211a0ef-166d-40e3-a87f-913ce24eb345,2026-08-18T12:43:15.829Z,31030746,12,"U1: find the perimeter of a sector of a circle of radius 14cm and sector angle 75 degree
U2: could you pls take pi= 22/7
U3: i did 75/360 * 2 * 22/7 * 14 = 75 * 22 * 2 this upon 180. is this correct if yes what should be my next step
U4: how did u get 28 in finiding the perimeter step
U5: how did u get 139/3 😭
U6: THANK YOU BUT PLS DONT SKIP SUCH STEPS BECAUSE I GET CONFUSED
U7: how do i solve 2 * 22/7 * 3.5
