ee7f487b-8aa2-42ae-a49c-d68b298bcaa6,2026-08-18T13:18:19.851Z,31211189,7,"U1: Draw the graph of x/2-y/3=3 linear equation
U2: Excuse me it says draw the graph nkt to solve it
