Activities of **producing or buying and selling** goods/services to **earn profit**.

## Profession
Work that needs **special education/training and skill**, and follows **rules/ethics** (like doctor, lawyer, CA).

## Employment
Having **paid work** (a job) to earn **income**. 
Types: **self-employment** (own shop) and **salaried/wage employment** (working for someone else).

## Home Trade (Domestic Trade)
Trade (buying and selling) **within the same country**.

## Foreign Trade (International Trade)
Trade **between different countries** (imports and exports).

## Economic Activity
Any activity done mainly to **earn money/income** (job, business, farming).

