U27: Bilkul, is question ko padhte hain 👇 *Question:* Ek dukaan mein 3 tarah ki toffiyan hain: - *A wali toffee* = ₹2 ki - *B wali toffee* = ₹3 ki - *C wali toffee* = ₹5 ki Tumhare paas *kul ₹20 hain* Aur tumhe *kul 7 toffiyan* kharidni hain *Sawal: Kya tum 7 toffiyan ₹20 mein kharid sakti ho Agar haan, toh kaise* --- *Answer:* *Haan, possible hai* ✅ 3 tarike hain: 1. *1 A + 6 B + 0 C* = 1×2 + 6×3 + 0×5 = 2 + 18 + 0 = *₹20* 2. *3 A + 3 B + 1 C* = 3×2 + 3×3 + 1×5 = 6 + 9 + 5 = *₹20* 3. *5 A + 0 B + 2 C* = 5×2 + 0×3 + 2×5 = 10 + 0 + 10 = *₹20* Teeno mein kul 7 toffiyan bhi ho rahi hain aur paise bhi ₹20 hi lag rahe hain. Samajh aaya Aur koi question ho to bhejo 💛
