Avi ने **7.5 kg** चीनी **₹48.75** में खरीदी। 
तो **1 kg का दाम = कुल पैसे ÷ कुल kg**

\[
48.75 \div 7.5
\]

अब दशमलव हटाने के लिए **दोनों को 10 से गुणा** कर दो:

\[
48.75 \div 7.5 = 487.5 \div 75
\]

अब 75 से भाग:

- \(75 \times 6 = 450\) 
बचे \(487.5 - 450 = 37.5\)

- \(75 \times 0.5 = 37.5\)

तो कुल \(6 + 0.5 = 6.5\)

**इसलिए 1 kg चीनी का दाम = \(\mathbf{₹6.50}\)**

अगर चाहो, तो बताओ: **7.5 kg और ₹48.75** वाले हिस्से में कन्फ्यूजन है या **भाग (division)** वाले हिस्से में?",Small Talk,5,5,5,10,Academic | Image Upload | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,14112,283,0.003497,"The bot successfully addressed the user's math questions with clear step-by-step explanations and responded in Hindi as requested. There were no technical or content failures, and the user expressed gratitude indicating satisfaction. The session included image upload and speech-to-text modalities, correctly tagged.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
