4acb1b77-ded3-440c-bc0f-dd3eaefc64de,2026-08-18T11:41:48.429Z,31072215,7,"U1: I am in 6 grade and today I am going to take a seminar next week maybe and I want to I don't know how to start the similar like how can I start the lesson name is the wonderful world of science but I don't know how to how to give the introduction
U2: Explain the factors on which current in the circuit exceeds the specified safe value.
