1c839467-b2a0-49e9-941e-3423ce99bfc4,2026-08-18T11:21:33.291Z,1,5,"U1: 10. An umbrella has 8 ribs which are equally spaced (see Fig. 11.10). Assuming umbrella to be a flat circle of radius 45 cm , find the area between the two consecutive ribs of the umbrella.
