U4: 19 / 7530 write it picture 19/ 7530 write it with picture I guess you photo","**I can’t send a real photo, but I can show you a clear “picture model” you can draw.**

**Picture (dot model): \(\frac{19}{7530}\) means “19 out of 7530.”**
1. Draw a big box.
2. Inside it, draw **100 small dots** (a \(10 \times 10\) dots box).
3. Now write under it: 
\[
\frac{19}{7530} \approx \frac{19}{7500}
\]
because \(7530\) is very close to \(7500\).

To make a picture that fits on paper, use **groups**:
- \(7530 = 75 \text{ groups of } 100 \text{ dots} + 30 \text{ dots}\)
