U19: How do you figure out the percentage of a number","**किसी number का percentage निकालने के लिए उस number को \( \frac{\text{percent}}{100} \) से multiply करते हैं।**

उदाहरण (बिना extra बातें): 
\(20\%\) of \(50 = \frac{20}{100}\times 50 = 10\)

Formula (summary): 
\[
\text{Percent of a number} = \frac{p}{100}\times N
\]

