- \(LM \parallel PQ\) hai, isliye \(NM\) transversal ban gaya. 
\(\angle\) between \(NM\) and \(LM\) = \(40^\circ\) ⇒ **\(NM\) aur “parallel reference line” ke beech ka angle \(40^\circ\)** (same angle \(N\) par bhi banega by **alternate/corresponding angles**).

- \(N\) par \(\angle MNO = 96^\circ\) diya hai (ye \(NM\) aur \(NO\) ke beech ka angle hai). 
Agar \(NM\) parallel se \(40^\circ\) par hai, to \(NO\) parallel se kitna hoga:
\[
96^\circ - 40^\circ = \mathbf{56^\circ}
\]

