Tab tak **general method** (badi sankhya ka multiplication) dekh lo:

Agar \(A \times B\) karna ho (jaise \(138 \times 57\)):

1) **Ones (ekai) se multiply** 
\(138 \times 7 = 966\)

2) **Tens (dahai) se multiply** (ek 0 lagate hain kyunki tens hai) 
\(138 \times 50 = 6900\)

3) **Dono ko add** 
\(966 + 6900 = 7866\)

Bas isi tarah har multiplication hota hai: **pehle ekai se**, phir **dahai se (0 ke saath)**, phir **addition**.

