U11: Mera physics ka question hai 10 v to question hai ki Abbas decreases its speed from 80 km per hour - 1 to 60 km per - sorry how are minus one in five second find acceleration of the bus","**बस का acceleration (त्वरण) \(\approx -1.11 \,\text{m/s}^2\)** (negative क्योंकि speed कम हो रही है)। 
(मैं calculator में extra digits रख रहा/रही हूँ, और दिखाने के लिए rounded numbers लिख रहा/रही हूँ।)

Speed km/h में है, इसलिए पहले **m/s** में बदलते हैं:

- Initial speed \(u = 80 \,\text{km/h} = 80 \times \frac{5}{18} \approx 22.22 \,\text{m/s}\)
- Final speed \(v = 60 \,\text{km/h} = 60 \times \frac{5}{18} \approx 16.67 \,\text{m/s}\)
- Time \(t = 5\,\text{s}\)

अब acceleration का मतलब है **speed में बदलाव / समय**:

\[
a = \frac{v-u}{t}
\]

\[
a = \frac{16.67 - 22.22}{5} = \frac{-5.55}{5} \approx -1.11 \,\text{m/s}^2
\]

इसलिए **acceleration \(\mathbf{\approx -1.11 \,\text{m/s}^2}\)** है। 

अगर चाहो तो मैं यही सवाल **sign (negative) क्यों आया** बहुत आसान शब्दों में भी समझा दूँ।",Small Talk,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Specific Named Resource | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,14880,271,0.003654,"The bot correctly understood and answered the user's academic queries with detailed explanations and conversions. There were no failures such as incorrect answers, context loss, or unwanted template pushes. The user did not express explicit satisfaction or dissatisfaction, so user sentiment is neutral.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
