- **Plant Physiology:** Photosynthesis के light reactions vs Calvin cycle; C3–C4–CAM comparison; Respiration और ETS/oxidative phosphorylation; Plant hormones (auxin, GA, cytokinin, ABA, ethylene) का mechanism + interactions; Water relations (ψ, transpiration, stomatal regulation). 
- **Cell & Molecular Biology:** Cell cycle control; DNA replication/repair; Transcription–translation regulation; Operon concept vs eukaryotic regulation; Gene expression techniques (PCR, blotting, sequencing) के principles. 
- **Genetics:** Mendelian deviations; Linkage–crossing over mapping; Gene mutations; Population genetics (Hardy–Weinberg) और forces; Quantitative genetics basics. 
- **Ecology:** Ecosystem energy flow & productivity; Biogeochemical cycles; Community ecology (succession, diversity indices); Species interactions; Conservation strategies & biodiversity. 
- **Systematics/Taxonomy:** ICN rules & types; Herbarium techniques; Numerical taxonomy/Cladistics; Molecular phylogeny basics; Angiosperm classification comparisons. 
- **Mycology/Plant Pathology:** Fungal life cycles (Ascomycetes/Basidiomycetes); Plant disease triangle; Host–pathogen interaction; Disease management strategies; Important diseases (rust/smut/wilt) conceptually. 
- **Plant Biotechnology/Tissue Culture:** Totipotency; Sterilization & culture media concept; Micropropagation stages; Somaclonal variation; Genetic transformation overview (Agrobacterium vs biolistics) principles.

