2) **Income के 5 heads** (salary, house property, business, capital gains, other sources) 
3) **Tax slab** कैसे लगता है? 
आप 1/2/3 लिख दें, मैं उसी को बहुत आसान तरीके से समझा दूँगा।**",Lesson_request,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Non-CBSE Board,,,0.9500,13718,262,0.003367,"The bot correctly understood and responded to the user's academic queries about B.Com subjects and concepts without any failures. The user named a non-CBSE board explicitly, so that category tag is applied. There are no bot failures or issues detected, but the user did not express explicit positive sentiment, so axis3 is neutral.",0,full_rate,Academic,Concept Explanation,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
