Tumhari situation:
- **Science:** complete (sirf revision)
- **GK:** sabse weak, **Chapter 3 chal raha hai** (total **11 chapters**)
- **Math:** sabse strong (total **6 chapters**)
- **English:** **9–10 chapters** (tumne bola 9 ya 10)

---

## ✅ Roz ka time (1.5–2 ghante me ho jayega)
- **GK:** 45 min (sabse zyada)
- **English:** 35 min
- **Math:** 25 min (kyunki strong)
- **Science revision:** 10–15 min (sirf repeat)

---

## ✅ 21 din ka target plan (date pata nahi, isliye din ke hisaab se)

### **Din 1–8: GK ko finish karna (fast + easy)**
- **GK:** Roz **1 chapter** (Chapter 3 se Chapter 10/11 tak) 
- Har chapter se: **10 one-word + 10 MCQ + 5 True/False**
- **English:** Roz **1 chapter** (8 din me 8 chapters)
- **Math:** Har 2 din me **1 chapter practice** (8 din me ~4 chapters)
- **Science:** 10 min revision

### **Din 9–14: Bacha hua syllabus complete**
- **GK:** bache hue chapters finish + purane 3 chapters ka quick revision
- **English:** bache hue chapters finish (9–10 complete)
- **Math:** bache hue chapters (6/6) + daily 15 sums

### **Din 15–21: Revision + test**
- **GK:** Roz 1 full revision + **30 questions** practice
- **English:** reading + grammar + 1 writing (paragraph/letter)
- **Math:** 1 mixed worksheet (tables, word problems)
- **Science:** 1 short test + revision

---

## GK ko easy banane ka simple tareeka
Har chapter ke liye **“GK Notebook”** banao:
- **20 important answers** (1 line)
- **5 difficult questions** alag se mark
- Roz 5 min me purana repeat

---

## Tumhare liye final “deadline”
- **Din 8 tak:** GK ka zyada part complete + English ka aadha complete 
- **Din 14 tak:** GK + English + Math **poora complete** 
- **Din 21 tak:** **2 baar revision + practice tests**

