9d179c55-7e5a-4bda-acf9-c18cc802b3c8,2026-08-18T05:00:26.994Z,31094352,5,"U1: A person sold a table at a gain of 15%.Had he bought it for 25% less and sold it for 60 less,he would have made a profit of 32%.The cost price of table was
