4.4 मूलों की प्रकृति","मान लीजिए उस दिन **निर्मित बर्तनों की संख्या** \(x\) है। 
तब **प्रत्येक नग की लागत** (₹ में) “संख्या के दुगुने से 3 अधिक” होगी, यानी
\[
\text{प्रति नग लागत}=2x+3
\]

कुल लागत ₹ \(90\) है, इसलिए
\[
x(2x+3)=90
\]
\[
2x^2+3x-90=0
\]

अब इस द्विघात को गुणनखंडित करें:
\[
2x^2+3x-90=(2x+15)(x-6)=0
\]

तो
\[
2x+15=0 \Rightarrow x=-\tfrac{15}{2}\ (\text{यह संभव नहीं})
\]
या
\[
x-6=0 \Rightarrow x=6
\]

अब प्रति नग लागत:
\[
2x+3=2(6)+3=15
\]

**अतः निर्मित बर्तनों की संख्या \(6\) और प्रत्येक नग की लागत ₹ \(15\) है।**",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Specific Named Resource | Image Upload,,,0.9500,13163,281,0.003308,"The bot correctly solved both math problems based on the images provided and responded appropriately to user requests. There were no failures or misunderstandings in the conversation, and the user did not express dissatisfaction. The session is a straightforward academic help with image uploads and specific question references.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,same_intent_reask | gate_llm,gate_llm
