U7: Class 10th or waek subject math, social science,odia","### **10th Board (Odisha) ke liye August–February plan (Weak: Math, Social Science, Odia)**

#### **1) Abhi se target (simple aur real)**
- **August–September:** Math ke basics strong + Social Science ke chapters 1st time + Odia writing practice start 
- **October–November:** 2nd revision + zyada practice (especially Math) 
- **December–January:** **sample paper/mock** + time management 
- **February:** quick revision + important questions

---

## **Daily routine (School ke saath) — 3–3.5 hours**
### **A) Math ( रोज़ ) — 60–90 min**
- **30 min:** concept + examples (formula/steps clear)
- **30–60 min:** **20–30 sums** (mixed practice)
- **Rule:** jo sums galat ho, unko “**mistake notebook**” me likho aur 2 din baad fir se karo

### **B) Social Science — 45–60 min**
- Ek din **History/Political**, next din **Geography/Economics**
- Har chapter ke liye:
- **10 min:** headings/keywords
- **20 min:** short answers
- **15–20 min:** long answers ka structure (points me)

### **C) Odia — 30–40 min**
- **15 min:** grammar/important rules
- **15–20 min:** writing (essay/letter/paragraph) me **handwriting + spelling** pe focus

---

## **Weekly plan (बहुत important)**
- **Saturday:** Math ka 1 chapter test (1–1.5 hr)
- **Sunday:** Social Science ka 1 chapter test + Odia writing 1 piece 
- Test ke baad **30 min analysis**: kya galti hui aur kyu

---

## **Fast improvement tips (topper-type)**
- **Math:** रोज़ practice nahi to marks nahi aate—isse skip mat karna
- **Social Science:** answers **points + keywords + map/diagram** (jahan hota ho)
- **Odia:** har week 2 writing जरूर—board me presentation se marks badhte hain

---

