Find two numbers \(a,b\) such that:
\[
a+b=34 \quad \text{and} \quad ab=225
\]
Checking factor pairs of \(225\), we get \(25\) and \(9\) because
\[
25+9=34,\qquad 25\cdot 9=225
\]
So,
